        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 19:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntuhambarire umutāma, arik’ umuhanūre nka so, n’abakiri bato n’imisore ubahanūre nka bene nyoko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n’abatamakazi nyene nka ba nyoko, n’abakiri bato n’abigeme nka bashiki bawe, uri n’umutima utanduye na gatoya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wubahe abapfakazi b’inyakamwe vy’ukuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko, umupfakazi wese, namb’ afise abana cank’ abuzukuru, ni babanze kwiga kwubaha Imana ku vyo bagirira ababo, no kwishura ivyiza abavyeyi babo: kukw ivyo ari vyo bishimwa mu nyonga z’Imana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.49.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 49:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.2.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 2:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.18.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umupfakazi w’inyakamwe asigaye ar’ umwe, yizigira Imana, agashishikara kwinginga no gusenga ku murango no mw ijoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko, uwihaye ukwifuza aba apfuye ahagaze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubabgirize ivyo, kugira ngo ntibabek’ umugayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arik’ umuntu n’atātunga abo mu nzu y’i wabo, cane‐cane abiwe, azoba yihakanye ukwizera, kand’ azoba abaye hanyuma y’ūtizera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntihakagire umupfakazi yandikirwa gufashwa ataramara imyaka mirongwitandatu y’amavuka, kandi handikwe uwar’ afiswe n’umugabo umwe gusa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.13.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 13:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "handikwe ūshimirwa ibikorwa vyiza, namba yararera abana, namba yaratanga indāro, yarōza ibirenge vy’abera, yarafasha abababaye, yarashishikara gukurikira ibikorwa vyiza vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw abapfakazi bakiri bato ntubemerere, kuko kwifuza kw’umubiri ni kwamara kubatera kugarariza Kristo bazogomba kwābīrwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bagatsindwa n’urubanza kuko bavuye mw isezerano ryabo rya mbere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TH.3.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tes 3:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ikindi, biga kugira ubunebge, bagenda imihana; ariko rero s’ubunebge gusa, ikigeretseko bararegeteranya bīta mu bitar’ ivyabo, bavuga ivyo badakwiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 7:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma ngomba kw abapfakazi bakiri bato bābīrwa, bakavyara abana, bakubaka ingo zabo, ntibahe umurwanizi urwitwazo rw’ibitutsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko n’ubu bamwe bamaze guta inzira, ngo bakurikire Satani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umugore wese yizera namb’ afise incuti z’abapfakazi, abafashe, ishengero ntiriremērwe, ribone gufasha abapfakazi b’inyakamwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
